    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30298" root="علق" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَاقِيَةٌ</span></b>  A man <i>who, when he clings to a thing,
will not quit it.</i> (S, O, K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِقٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفْسٌ عَلَاقِيَةٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلِقْنَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A devoted,</i> or <i>an
attacked, soul; one that clings to a thing persistently.</i> (L, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِلَاقَةٌ</span>.

